WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.575
Stephen King's planning cycle asks five questions.

00:00:03.625 --> 00:00:04.801
Where are we?

00:00:04.851 --> 00:00:06.169
Why are we there?

00:00:06.219 --> 00:00:07.525
Where could we be?

00:00:07.575 --> 00:00:09.011
How could we get there?

00:00:09.061 --> 00:00:10.906
Are we getting there?

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.642
Telstra started as a national punchline, barely above the tax office.

00:00:15.692 --> 00:00:16.503
Why?

00:00:16.553 --> 00:00:19.222
Boring, transactional ads.

00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:21.180
Where could it be?

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:22.548
A loved brand.

00:00:22.598 --> 00:00:23.398
How?

00:00:23.435 --> 00:00:25.838
Emotional, crafted brand building.

00:00:25.888 --> 00:00:29.283
Then track brand health, and the loop starts again.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.969
So walk the brand through every stage honestly.

00:00:33.019 --> 00:00:37.446
Evaluation is never the end, it's the next starting point.
